{"ref":"BDB, אַחְיוֹ","hw":"אַחְיוֹ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַחְיוֹ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אחיון</span>, i.e. <em>fraternal</em><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Aminadab, brother of Uzzah <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.3\">2 S 6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.4\">4</a> (𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחָיו</span>, We <span dir=\"rtl\">אָחִיו</span> but v. Dr) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.7\">1 Ch 13:7</a> (𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחָיו</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.14\">1 Ch 8:14</a>, but read <span dir=\"rtl\">אָחִיו</span> 𝔊 Be.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.31\">1 Ch 8:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.37\">9:37</a> (> 𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחָיו</span>).","next":"BDB, אֲחִיחֻד","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיהוּד"}